For GPU ACTIVE duration, union overlapping Vertex/Fragment/Compute intervals within each encoder/CB. CB SPAN is first GPU-stage start to last GPU-stage end, including interstage stalls; do not sum CB spans. Union all stages in each app frame for actual frame GPU occupancy. Sums of per-encoder occupancy can exceed frame union because stages from different encoders overlap.
